{"id": "19-336-2-12", "zh": "146. 在 ga、yo、nā、se 之前，bhavanta 可选地变为 bhonta", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-337-2-13", "zh": "bhavanta 一词在 ga、yo、nā、se 之前可选地替换为 bhonta。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-337-14-20", "zh": "以 nto 作替换：bhonto、bhontā、bhavanto、bhavantā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-337-21-35", "zh": "而在呼格单数（ga）时：bho、bhonta、bhontā、bhava、bhavā、bhavaṃ；bhonto、bhontā、bhavanto、bhavantā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-337-36-45", "zh": "在替换为 bhonta 的情况下，由于“多样”（bahula）一语的管辖，ṭa、ṭā、aṃ 这些替换形不出现。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-337-46-51", "zh": "bhavaṃ、bhavantaṃ；bhonte、bhavante。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-337-52-59", "zh": "bhotā、bhontena、bhavatā、bhavantena；bhavantehi、bhavantebhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-337-60-68", "zh": "bhoto、bhontassa、bhavato、bhavassa、bhavantassa；bhavataṃ、bhavantānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-337-69-72", "zh": "bhavatā 等其余各形与 gacchanta 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-338-2-19", "zh": "bho 是用于称呼的不变词，因为在复数中也能见到这种用法，例如“诸位，你们三个人是从哪里来的？”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-338-20-22", "zh": "bhante 也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-338-23-26", "zh": "bhadde 是由另一个词 bhadda 构成的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-338-27-30", "zh": "bhaddanta 是由 d 重复而构成的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-339-2-7", "zh": "saṃ、santo；santo、santā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-339-8-15", "zh": "呼格：bho sa、sā、saṃ；santo、santā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-339-16-39", "zh": "saṃ、santaṃ——依“saṃyogādilopo”一条删去 n，例如“国王啊，一个人无论亲近哪一个人，不论他是善人还是恶人”；sante。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-339-40-42", "zh": "satā、santena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-340-2-6", "zh": "145. 在 bh 之前，santa 变为 saba", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-341-2-6", "zh": "santa 一词在 bh 音之前变为 saba。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-341-7-9", "zh": "sabbhi、santehi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-341-10-14", "zh": "由于这条规则是必然的，所以不出现 santebhi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-341-15-20", "zh": "sato、sassa、santassa 等其余各形与 gacchanta 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-342-2-8", "zh": "150. mahanta 与 arahanta 可选地变为 ṭā", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-343-2-10", "zh": "在 si 之前，mahanta 与 arahanta 的 nta 可选地替换为 ṭā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-343-11-17", "zh": "mahā、mahaṃ、mahanto；mahanto、mahantā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-343-18-25", "zh": "arahā、arahaṃ；arahanto、arahantā，其余各形与 gacchanta 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-344-2-4", "zh": "asma 加 si，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-345-2-4", "zh": "154. 在 rāja 等与 yuva 等之后，si 变为 ā", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-346-2-10", "zh": "在 rāja 等词与 yuva 等词之后的 si 变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-346-11-12", "zh": "asmā，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-347-2-6", "zh": "156. yo 变为 āno", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-348-2-10", "zh": "在 rāja 等词与 yuva 等词之后，yo 可选地变为 āno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-348-11-13", "zh": "asmāno、asmā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-348-14-20", "zh": "呼格：bho asma、asmā；asmāno、asmā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-349-2-8", "zh": "155. 在 aṃ 之前可选地变为 ānaṅa", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-350-2-8", "zh": "rāja 等词与 yuva 等词在 aṃ 之前可选地变为 ānaṅa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-350-9-14", "zh": "asmānaṃ、asmaṃ；asmāno、asme。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-351-2-6", "zh": "80. nā 变为 eno", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-352-2-7", "zh": "在 kamma 等词之后，具格词尾 nā 可选地变为 eno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-352-8-13", "zh": "asmena、asmanā；asmehi、asmebhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-352-14-17", "zh": "asmassa；asmānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-352-18-22", "zh": "asmā、asmamhā、asmasmā，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-353-2-4", "zh": "79. 在 kamma 等之后", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-354-2-7", "zh": "在 kamma 等词之后，smiṃ 可选地变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-354-8-14", "zh": "asmani、asme、asmamhi、asmasmiṃ；asmesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-354-15-25", "zh": "kamma、camma、vesma、bhasma、brahma、atta、ātuma、ghamma、muddha，这些是 kamma 等词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-354-26-31", "zh": "muddha、gaṇḍivadhanva、aṇima、laghima 等词的变化与 asma 相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-354-32-42", "zh": "rāja、brahma、sakha、atta、ātuma、gaṇḍivadhanva、asma、aṇima、laghima 等，这些是 rāja 等词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-355-2-18", "zh": "由于词群规则“dhamma 用于指他物时可选”把它列入了 rāja 等词之中，所以 daḷadhamma 可作 daḷadhammo，也可作 daḷadhammā。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-355-19-27", "zh": "yuva、sā、suvā、maghava、puma、vattaha，这些是 yuva 等词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-355-28-32", "zh": "rājā；rājāno、rājā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-355-33-38", "zh": "呼格：bho rāja、rājā；rājāno、rājā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-355-39-44", "zh": "rājānaṃ、rājaṃ；rājāno、rāje。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-356-2-5", "zh": "123. 在 nā 之前，rāja 的末尾变为 i", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-357-2-13", "zh": "这一条是针对“Sabbadattena rājinā”（被 Sabbadatta 王）这个读法而设立的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-357-14-18", "zh": "在 nā 之前，rāja 的末尾可选地变为 i。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-357-19-20", "zh": "rājinā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-358-2-7", "zh": "222. 在 nā 与 smā 之前变为 raññā", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-359-2-10", "zh": "在 nā 与 smā 之前，rāja 连同词尾一律变为 raññā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-359-11-13", "zh": "因为替换形由多个音组成，所以替换整个词。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-359-14-15", "zh": "raññā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-360-2-8", "zh": "124. 在 su、naṃ、hi 之前变为 ū", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-361-2-11", "zh": "在 su、naṃ、hi 之前，rāja 可选地变为 ū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-361-12-17", "zh": "依“chaṭṭhiyantassa”一条，这一替换作用于词的末尾。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-361-18-22", "zh": "rājūhi、rājehi、rājūbhi、rājebhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-362-2-9", "zh": "223. 在 se 之前变为 rañño、raññassa、rājino", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-363-2-8", "zh": "在 se 之前，rāja 连同词尾变为这几种替换形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-363-9-14", "zh": "rañño、raññassa、rājino；rājūnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-364-2-5", "zh": "221. rāja 变为 raññaṃ", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-365-2-8", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，rāja 连同词尾可选地变为 raññaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-365-9-10", "zh": "raññaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-365-11-17", "zh": "raññā；rājūhi、rājehi、rājūbhi、rājebhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-366-2-7", "zh": "224. 在 smiṃ 之前变为 raññe、rājini", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-367-2-10", "zh": "在 smiṃ 之前，rāja 连同词尾一律变为 raññe 与 rājini。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-367-11-16", "zh": "raññe、rājini；rājūsu、rājesu。", "confidence": 85}
